Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,That loss might have\Nbeen a {\c&H1EB0F2&}good{\c&HFAF7F5&} trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:06.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,You followed your plan\Nand risked what you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:10.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,meant to. The market\Njust went the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:14.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's a good trade with\Na bad {\c&H1EB0F2&}outcome.{\c&HFAF7F5&} A bad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:18.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,trade breaks your rules,\Neven if it makes money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:21.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,When you review, sort\Nlosses into {\c&H1EB0F2&}two{\c&HFAF7F5&} piles.
