Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,Only the {\c&H1EB0F2&}second{\c&HFAF7F5&} pile\Nneeds fixing. The first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:29.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,pile is part of trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:32.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,TradeNotes asks, did you\N{\c&H1EB0F2&}follow{\c&HFAF7F5&} your plan, on
